      "local_deviation": "Organization membership, registries, SMTP credentials, clusters, audit, and Gene policies require Cloud tenant authority. Local renderer state never stores registry or SMTP secrets.",
      "judgment_rationale": "OrgSettingsLayout and its information, member, cluster, audit, registry, SMTP and Gene-policy children form one canonical Web area; its registry, Gene-policy and non-default cluster authorization defects keep Web degraded. Desktop has a revision-bound Cloud route, App binding and typed page for tenant information and stats, registries, SMTP and Gene policies with role checks. Those page-reachable actions are available, but the native page does not reproduce the tenant-settings, member, cluster or audit navigation and does not render the Web cluster list or status, so Cloud remains partial. Local organization governance remains not applicable."
